    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day Joshua made a covenant for the people, and there at Shechem he reaffirmed for them decrees and laws.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joshua recorded these things in the Book of the Law of God. Then he took a large stone and set it up there under the oak near the holy place of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.24.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"See!\" he said to all the people. \"This stone will be a witness against us. It has heard all the words the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.24.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has said to us. It will be a witness against you if you are untrue to your God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Joshua dismissed the people, each to their own inheritance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buried in the Promised Land",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After these things, Joshua son of Nun, the servant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.24.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", died at the age of a hundred and ten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they buried him in the land of his inheritance, at Timnath Serah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "in the hill country of Ephraim, north of Mount Gaash.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel served the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.24.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "throughout the lifetime of Joshua and of the elders who outlived him and who had experienced everything the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.24.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had done for Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joseph's bones, which the Israelites had brought up from Egypt, were buried at Shechem in the tract of land that Jacob bought for a hundred pieces of silver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "from the sons of Hamor, the father of Shechem. This became the inheritance of Joseph's descendants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Eleazar son of Aaron died and was buried at Gibeah, which had been allotted to his son Phinehas in the hill country of Ephraim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
